From aae31da3b3f327cade21fc916814b898d23c0f0d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hanro <hlareman2@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 19:45:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] WM Shell: add optional desktop caption provider hook

Expose an optional DynamicOverride factory for per-task caption content. Preserve stock behavior without the override, keep client-decorated caption gestures in Shell, and route the Maton maximize control through the existing immersive action.

Agent: Codex
Task: caption-host
Change-Id: I769f97ef52e9f6f96242b3359a4a26640c4d0b45
